    "northStar": "The Precise Terminal",
    "overview": "Pure black, neon green and terminal typography give the shared desktop and browser interface its hacker/cyberpunk identity. This is an Operate surface: the identity supports real network tasks through familiar controls, clear results and explicit capability states.",
